    <string name="about_title">About power-tv</string>
    <string name="about_version">Version %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_body">A local-first Android system monitor inspired by btop.\n\nCPU and memory come from /proc. Temperatures use public thermal APIs plus readable sysfs sensors. GPU counters are vendor-specific and may be unavailable. Android restricts process visibility for normal apps.\n\nAll telemetry stays on this device — power-tv has no network access.</string>
